---@field dbStorageType? aws.timestream_influxdb.DbStorageType The Timestream for InfluxDB DB storage type that InfluxDB stores data on.
---@field allocatedStorage? aws.timestream_influxdb.AllocatedStorage The amount of storage allocated for your DB storage type (in gibibytes).
---@field deploymentType? aws.timestream_influxdb.DeploymentType Specifies whether the Timestream for InfluxDB is deployed as Single-AZ or with a MultiAZ Standby for High availability.
---@field vpcSubnetIds aws.timestream_influxdb.VpcSubnetIdList A list of VPC subnet IDs associated with the DB instance.
---@field publiclyAccessible? boolean Indicates if the DB instance has a public IP to facilitate access.
---@field vpcSecurityGroupIds? aws.timestream_influxdb.VpcSecurityGroupIdList A list of VPC security group IDs associated with the DB instance.
---@field dbParameterGroupIdentifier? aws.timestream_influxdb.DbParameterGroupIdentifier The id of the DB parameter group assigned to your DB instance.
