---@field secondaryAvailabilityZone? string The Availability Zone in which the standby instance is located when deploying with a MultiAZ standby instance.
---@field logDeliveryConfiguration? aws.timestream_influxdb.LogDeliveryConfiguration Configuration for sending InfluxDB engine logs to send to specified S3 bucket.
