---@field instanceMode? aws.timestream_influxdb.InstanceMode Specifies the DbInstance's role in the cluster.
---@field instanceModes? aws.timestream_influxdb.InstanceModeList Specifies the DbInstance's roles in the cluster.
---@field maintenanceSchedule? aws.timestream_influxdb.MaintenanceSchedule The maintenance schedule for the DB instance.
---@field lastMaintenanceTime? string The timestamp of the last completed maintenance operation on the DB instance.
